<BaseLayout title="SWEEP Kidz Pre-School" description="SWEEP Kidz Pre-School focuses on holistic child development in a loving, safe and stimulating Christian environment in Suideroord, Johannesburg.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container page-hero-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">The early formative years</span><h1>SWEEP Kidz <em style="color:var(--green-2);font-style:normal">Pre-School</em></h1><p>A wonderful place for your child’s early formative years. We focus on the holistic development of each child—physical, spiritual, emotional, social and cognitive.</p><a class="button" href="/admissions/">Ask about admissions <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><img src={image} alt="SWEEP Kidz Pre-School, image from the existing school website" fetchpriority="high" /></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container content-grid"><div class="prose"><h2>We receive our Sweepies in love and promise to:</h2><ul><li>Provide a loving and safe environment where children and parents feel comfortable.</li><li>Lay a Christian foundation directed by Matthew 19:14.</li><li>Create a stimulating and friendly environment.</li><li>Focus on developing awareness, sensitivity and tolerance towards one another.</li><li>Encourage enthusiasm, allowing children to develop as individuals.</li><li>Develop a close relationship between parents, children and staff.</li><li>Employ dedicated and well-trained staff with a passion for children.</li><li>Be a well-respected and trusted nursery school in our community.</li></ul><h2>Scope and curriculum</h2><p>SWEEP Kidz caters for children aged two years and up, and gladly assists with potty training. The school uses the Step-By-Step Christian programme together with the CAPS Curriculum, engaging with one another in English.</p><p>Children are introduced to Numeracy, Literacy and Life Skills from a young age. Each child receives a Portfolio of Evidence at the end of the year. The school also identifies itself as a member of the Early Childhood Development Forum.</p><h2>Facilities</h2><p>The existing school website lists age-appropriate individual classrooms for each age group, a dedicated outdoor play area with shaded sandpits, a well-equipped kitchen to cater for children’s dietary needs, a well-stocked tuck shop and secure parking with easy access and exit.</p><p>The website also lists Jungle Rumble indoor play centre and children’s party venue, and Cine+ walk-in cinema. Please confirm the current availability and relationship of these facilities to the school before publication.</p><h2>Extra-mural activities</h2><p>The existing website references Soccer Starz and Dance Mouse, as well as Technokids computer training. Current providers, age groups, schedules and availability need to be reconfirmed by the school.</p></div><aside class="info-card"><h3>Planning a visit?</h3><p>Speak with the school about age groups, admissions, daily routines and the current fee schedule.</p><p><strong>Telephone</strong><br /><a href="tel:+27116805938">011 680 5938</a></p><p><strong>Email</strong><br /><a href="mailto:schools@sweeplife.co.za">schools@sweeplife.co.za</a></p><p class="muted">Contact details are copied from the public website and must be confirmed before launch.</p><a class="button" href="/admissions/">Admissions enquiry <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></aside></div></section>
</BaseLayout>